+A source can set `provider` to choose how its signature is checked. The default is `generic`: hex HMAC-SHA256 in `X-Signature`. With `acme`, it is hex HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body in `X-Acme-Signature`. An unknown provider stops startup.
+
+```json
+{ "acme": { "secret": "...", "target": "https://client.example/in", "provider": "acme" } }
+```
+
 A source can slow down its retries with an optional `retry` object. The delay starts at `baseDelayMs` (default 100), doubles on each retry and is capped at `maxDelayMs` (default: no cap). Invalid values stop startup.
 
 ```json
